  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We will not receive any cash\nproceeds from the issuance of the Ordinary Shares offered by this prospectus. The Ordinary Shares offered by this prospectus will be issued\nas consideration in the Business Combination and in satisfaction of the other obligations described under \u201cThe Issuance,\u201d\nand not for cash. We will bear the costs, fees and expenses incurred in effecting the registration of the Ordinary Shares covered by this\nprospectus, including printing and delivery fees and the fees and expenses of our counsel and our accountants. This offering will not\nprovide us with any capital to fund our operations or to address the substantial doubt about our ability to continue as a going concern.\nSee \u201cRisk Factors\u201d and \u201cExpenses Related to the Offering.\u201d Field: Page; Sequence: 214; Value: 1 Alt- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo 6 Field: /Sequence Field: /Page PLAN OF",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS An investment in the Ordinary\nShares involves a high degree of risk. The section entitled \u201cRisk Factors\u201d included elsewhere in the registration statement\nof which this prospectus forms a part sets forth the risks relating to the Business Combination, to our business and industry, to our\nbecoming a public company through the Business Combination, to the limited public float of the Ordinary Shares, to our status as a former\nshell company and the unavailability of Rule 144, and to the ownership of the Ordinary Shares, and that section forms a part of this prospectus\nin its entirety. You should carefully consider those risks, together with the other information in this prospectus, before deciding to\ninvest in the Ordinary Shares. The risk factor captioned \u201cRisks Related to this Offering by the Selling Shareholders\u201d addresses\nthe resale of Ordinary Shares under the Resale Prospec",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
